A||||9||avengador1||Here a quick way to add Bass to your stereo||||1||
Z||000000||avengador1||11-04-2001||01:36 PM||||I found this in Crutchfield. Its a powered bi-ampliflied woofer enclosure. Its made by Kenwood and only uses 0.34 cu. ft. of space. It has a 5 1/4" dual 2-ohm voice coil woofer and a 6 1/2" passive radiator plus a wired remote. It fits in the footwell and still leaves room for your feet. I was going to modify a factory sub enclosure and buy an amp but this was a direct bolt in and only took 1/2 hour to install and setup. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Camer017_1.jpg[/img]and.[img]http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Camer016.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||avengador1||11-04-2001||01:37 PM||||Picture here. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Camer016.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Formula||11-04-2001||01:38 PM||||you did it first heh.<p>[This message has been edited by Formula (edited 11-04-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000003||avengador1||11-04-2001||01:38 PM||||and here. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Camer017_2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||avengador1||11-04-2001||01:40 PM||||Be carefull where you put the screws, as they are close to the heater core. The flap still operates correctly.||||reg||1
Z||000005||Jaei Sun||11-04-2001||03:28 PM||||Most importantly how does it sound??<P>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://home.mn.rr.com/fierojaei/Jaei_blue.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000006||avengador1||11-04-2001||03:47 PM||||It won't stop your heart bass, but it will rattle your insides. I think the owners manual stated that it had 100 watts peak output. It sounds pretty good. You can adjust the cut in frequency (I leave it at the lowest)and adjust the output level. You can also make it play out of phase 180 degrees. I wanted to keep the inside of my car looking closer to stock and retain full use of as much interior space as possible. I think this is an excellent compromise. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Camer003.jpg"> ||||reg||10
Z||000007||Jaei Sun||11-04-2001||04:52 PM||||Yeah that interior looks good...nice steering wheel and shift knob!  So do you think it's possible to put the whole inclosure where the factory sub used to be??||||reg||1
Z||000008||avengador1||11-04-2001||05:07 PM||||It just fit in the footwell, you could probably mount it higher and more towards the passennger area but that would take some fabrication. I wanted quick and dirty but neat looking.||||reg||1
Z||000009||avengador1||11-04-2001||05:10 PM||||Here's a better view of the shifter. It's a Grant and so is the wheel. I also have the carbon fiber dash covers. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Camer019.jpg"> ||||reg||1
